{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "7b01cfe4a76ea04644b4593523d5050a5342783387d2e6e30cab10818dfe6708", "ja": "色めく熱をあなたに", "zh": "将绚烂的狂热献给你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "50f89702cd8a0cd7b4597bd28a50d493892a2fd911112f99db7bd34638f1bf22", "ja": "天体公演が始まり、新曲の披露が近づく。\nアイドル達の気合いは十分！\nファンのために……そして、\nプロデューサーを見返すために！\n最高に熱いステージへ向かうのだった。", "zh": "天体公演拉开帷幕，新曲的公开已近在眼前。\n偶像们早已干劲十足！\n为了粉丝……也是为了\n让制作人刮目相看！\n她们迈向了那炽热至极的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "aae8d7faf638ad6bbd48b1257911500061d926a732930d59850f455ee2e4c065", "ja": "（いよいよ、天体公演が始まった。\nまもなく、新曲のお披露目だ！）", "zh": "（天体公演终于开始了。新歌马上就要首次登台了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "cdedba3b904a73862afa2ee88785e3f16714a254f6bde32e4cec226adfb191f1", "ja": "やれることは全部やったと思う。\nあとは本番で全力を出すだけ……みんながんばろうね！", "zh": "能做的都已经全部做好了。\n接下来只要在正式演出中全力以赴就行了……大家一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "ccc5c806d87293cfe1e3c0adae6463cffb089c1da3db3ce361c01e3d00fb5c2d", "ja": "うん！　私達のすべてをぶつけよう！\nん～～～っ！　気合いはいってきたー！", "zh": "嗯！把我们的一切都发挥出来吧！\n嗯～～～！干劲越来越足了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "412880ae7b45d8f12e6e22bb418c731b95dac8cacfe20c3fdef6c9b1743f336b", "ja": "さらけ出すのは、まだ怖かったりもしますけど……\nでも、いつもと違うありさをみてもらいたいです！", "zh": "虽然把自己彻底展现出来，有时还是会让人害怕……\n\n不过，我想让大家看看与平时不同的亜利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "39cbc8909dfbd31ce19fd34a2b77053ec8e1dcf502f0ea110f17743cc3f9fa4c", "ja": "そうですね。私も精一杯、がんばります。……それに、\n最初の頃に、亜利沙さんが言ってくれましたから。", "zh": "是啊。我也会竭尽全力努力的……而且，刚开始的时候，亚利沙曾经对我说过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "ebfad0a88e99633bb84fa2294013bee35af59c2f673c02d7bab100f5f2282ad2", "ja": "へっ？　ありさ、何か言いましたか？", "zh": "诶？亚利沙说过什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "6ca6a651ad76416d8316d697b9a5d8b7ea6142dbaf5b2d800e52121fc62916a8", "ja": "その……私も、セクシーなんですよね？\nあの時そう言われて、悪い気はしませんでした。", "zh": "那个……我也是性感的，对吧？\n那时候听你那么说，我并不讨厌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "b794ada71566441d14f9a92fa9c05f01c8f5e1b63a266dea15e44ec44488fe39", "ja": "し、志保ちゃん！　本番前にそんなこと言われたら\nありさは……！　あっ、目の前が涙で滲んで……。", "zh": "志、志保！要是在正式演出前被你这么说，亚利沙会……！啊，眼前都被泪水模糊了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "193181a0efad055e877c8400fb65153ea6a5e6a9324ac6ebd16400f90cdd0b43", "ja": "ああっ！？　もうメイクを直す時間はないからな！\n我慢だぞ、亜利沙！", "zh": "啊！？已经没时间补妆了！\n忍住啊，亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "aaa66362de7abece629524955bc8f4383385a46c56dd597fd4e66daba21efb55", "ja": "わ、わかってますよぉ！", "zh": "我、我知道啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "916180c48c18d32e0d1c56f34cdc946c7c79b34485d9cd2709afe3a532c4cd44", "ja": "{$P$}、見ててくださいね？\n私たちのこと、必ず認めさせてみせますから！", "zh": "{$P$}，请看好了哦？\n我们一定会让他们认可我们的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "53e3c633e30c5e142465d9407db422b3a73c37c21bdbf5837d2878d7432c601a", "ja": "いや、あれは誤解というか……\nみんなの事は、ちゃんとセクシーだと思ってるよ！", "zh": "不，那是个误会，该怎么说呢……\n我是真觉得大家都很性感的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "9f07898a31c9f8cd2e3872e1c0c9ce0563ad91e5ff88b6e396f2773837115133", "ja": "ほんとに～？　でもでも、今さらだけどね！　私たちを\nやる気にさせたのは、{$P$}だし！", "zh": "真的吗～？不过不过，现在才说这个也太晚啦！让我们打起精神的可是，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "3a3e6711ad422cb7c99995879afa1f58d1c24ecaa9d5cf092eb222a347e4a342", "ja": "ステージを見て、ちゃんと判断してください。\n今言われても、信用できません。", "zh": "看完舞台表演后，请好好做出判断。\n现在才这么说，我可没法相信你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "90cedbec8a3448a67baa6c2698ccc3771accefca36867a6ee5cfeaa8f5288995", "ja": "そ、それもそうだな……わかった。\nみんなの成果を、見せてもらうよ！", "zh": "这、这话也有道理……知道了。\n让我看看大家的成果吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "a18764c1ecef2b28c92f5cfa24047e4110bb215e7f6aff5dd57cac632c305df3", "ja": "くっ……本来ならありさがみんなのベストショットを\n撮影して、証明してみせるところですが……！", "zh": "唔……按理说，应该由亚利沙拍下大家最棒的照片来证明才对，可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ade10b4274f15caf4b45e6d18acc208e3cd9c32c981e6e01211a359af12eaba2", "ja": "大丈夫だから、亜利沙は本番に集中してくれ！", "zh": "没事的，亜利沙你专心准备正式演出吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1017_se", "source_sha256": "e4b904728ec5fa1f15e602b49dfd2dfe9265645c26f84332e9b218b6033ab743", "ja": "ワァァァァァ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "bad583119f25c0b4e812a08f4c4aea05ab3102a27e5624d4d1e187033e35eb81", "ja": "あっ。前の曲が終わりましたね。\nそれじゃ行ってきます、{$P$}！", "zh": "啊。前一首歌结束了呢。\n那我出发了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "36715a0db82dfed3cebfb77240a999689b9a75e47453710dab9c549718e0684c", "ja": "ああ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "6c4f0157192cf18f8a61868899d58da7dffe927e522d9259579f64df6673f29b", "ja": "みんなー、楽しんでるー！？\nまだまだ盛り上げるから、覚悟してねー☆", "zh": "大家——玩得开心吗——！？\n接下来还会继续炒热气氛，可要做好心理准备哦——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "669d0abf8eb20ac18b44432d2b8415f4a7f97ab0989bfc7a4cb8957cc8bcf25c", "ja": "みなさーん！\n全力のコールをお願いしますーっ！", "zh": "各位——！\n请全力喊起来——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_06_1022_se", "source_sha256": "e4b904728ec5fa1f15e602b49dfd2dfe9265645c26f84332e9b218b6033ab743", "ja": "ワァァァァァ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
